@title S2 EP 03 • THE GROUP CHAT
@bg dorm_room_day
@show maya
Monday. The team group chat has 412 unread messages. The top one is from Maya: a screenshot of Chloe's private story. Chloe calling Maya "a gossip with a jersey."
@show chloe
Chloe: (in your doorway) She screenshotted my CLOSE FRIENDS. I'm going to kill her. Hold my gloves.
> [Good] "Chloe. Breathe. Don't do it in the chat." -> g1
> [Bitchy] "Honestly? She IS a gossip with a jersey." -> g2
> [Bold] "Then fight back. Post Maya's screenshots too." -> g3
> [Bad] Text Maya: "Chloe's coming for you lol" -> g4
*g1
@add Chloe_Friendship 2
Chloe: (sitting down hard) I hate how reasonable you are. Okay. In person. After practice.
@jump g_done
*g2
@add Chloe_Friendship 3
@add Maya_Friendship -2
Chloe: (actually smiling) Okay, we're best friends now. Sorry, I don't make the rules.
@jump g_done
*g3
@add Drama 3
@add Chloe_Friendship 2
@add Maya_Friendship -3
Chloe posts the screenshots of the screenshots. Maya posts receipts of the receipts. By lunch, nobody remembers what started it. By dinner, three girls have left the chat.
@jump g_done
*g4
@add Maya_Friendship 2
@add Chloe_Friendship -3
