@bg soccer_pitch_day
@show amara
At practice, Amara is crying behind the bench.
Amara: Brooke's talking to Tyler. And Tyler's best friend is Drew. And Drew is the swimmer I like. And now Drew thinks I'm "part of Brooke's whole thing." I'm not part of anybody's whole thing.
@show brooke
Brooke: (jogging past, sweetly) Cheer up, Amara! He was never gonna like you anyway, babe. He likes girls who start.
Amara's face crumples. Half the team heard it.
> [Bitchy] "Brooke, you've been benched three games. Sit down." -> b1
> [Sweet] Put your arm around Amara. Ignore Brooke completely. -> b2
> [Bold] Tackle Brooke in the next drill. Clean. Hard. -> b3
> [Good] Tell Coach. -> b4
*b1
@add Brooke_Friendship -3
@add Amara_Friendship 3
@add Drama 1
@show simone
Simone: (slow clap) Ohhh. Somebody get the girl a microphone.
Brooke goes red to her ears. She'll remember this.
@add Brooke_Grudge 2
@jump b_done
*b2
@add Amara_Friendship 3
@add Simone_Friendship 2
Amara: (into your shoulder) Why is she like this?
Simone: (from your other side) 'Cause she's scared Jordan won't come back this time.
@jump b_done
*b3
@add Brooke_Friendship -2
@add Jordan_Friendship 3
@add Amara_Friendship 2
